        "created_at": "2015-08-19T19:15:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Why did Captain Cosmic's brother go insane? Alien powers can do strange things to ordinary people.</p><p>(For the record I'm don't think it's Dana, more likely to be either an ex of CC's or an entirely new alien personage, see Star Sapphire for the Green Lantern parallels)</p>",
